Nodes 4
Tiers 2
Podsize 4

# Generated from the hacc_leaf_4x100g fabric profile. One leaf switch with
# 4 directly attached hosts and one uplink to each of 4 spine
# switches. Every host pair is same-leaf, so the spines carry no traffic:
# the measured fabric is a single switch hop and a same-leaf pair
# reproduces it exactly.
#
# 515 ns per pipe over 4 pipe traversals puts the
# smallest message's round trip at the measured latency floor once the
# store-and-forward serializations are added.
Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 515
Switch_Latency_ns 0

# 4 spine switches, each with one link to the leaf.
Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 515
Switch_Latency_ns 0
